Knoten B: & $I_{2}+I_{R3}+I_{D~} = 0$ 

Knoten C: & $I_{3}+I_{R5}-I_{D~} = 0$ 

Knoten D: & $I_{4}+I_{R1}-I_{R5} = 0$ 

Knoten E: & $I_{5}+I_{R2}-I_{R1} = 0$ 

